        <mxCell id="policy" value="UC-07: Free Planned + Active trips &lt;= 2; inclusive duration &lt;= 5 days (end - start + 1). Active Paid: no Free-tier count/duration limits.&#10;Use verified membership and applicable entitlements; preserve existing trips; record both snapshots if membership changes. UC-07 does not alter itinerary or pricing.&#10;Confirmed amendments repeat affected checks; changes to routing/risk/approval require full reconfirmation. Waiting, revision and referral do not close the Case (SM-01)." vertex="1" parent="1" style="fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#222222;strokeColor=#555555;fillColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f2f2f2;align=left;spacing=14;fontSize=17;">
